  "reason": "The existing evidence shows multimodal models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve ~0.526 accuracy, but it's unclear if unimodal RNA-only models could perform similarly or better. This experiment tests a simple RNA-only baseline using the same pca_n2000 encoder as previous multimodal models, isolating the impact of adding image data. It directly addresses whether multimodal integration provides value, a key design choice with limited prior evidence."
}

